OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fwith clear spells overnight. A few
OL,7,Fisolated showers may affect northwest
OL,8,Fcoasts. Strengthening winds and rain
OL,9,Farrive in the west by dawn. Chilly in
OL,10,Frural areas, with a local grass frost
OL,11,Fpossible away from the northwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FCloud and rain will spread
OL,14,Ferratically eastwards throughout the
OL,15,Fday. Rain turning heavier at times,
OL,16,Fparticularly in the north, with the
OL,17,Fsoutheast likely remaining dry until
OL,18,Fafter dark.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
